{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00713",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.03,
      "end_seconds": 12.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. Nothing to report, really, I'm only here because the letter said it was time for the pacemaker check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.28,
      "end_seconds": 26.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.86,
      "text": "That's the best sort of visit. Have you had any symptoms at all since I saw you last?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.38,
      "end_seconds": 42.67,
      "duration_seconds": 12.29,
      "text": "Not a thing, really. Well, I get a bit tired going up the hill by the church, but at my age I'd expect that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.0,
      "end_seconds": 50.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Fair enough. No dizzy spells or blackouts? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.85,
      "end_seconds": 61.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "None. I'd have told you. I'm very good at telling people things. Ask my wife. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.75,
      "end_seconds": 72.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "Let me check your pulse and blood pressure first. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.41,
      "end_seconds": 78.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Go on. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.36,
      "end_seconds": 94.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Pulse 62 and regular, blood pressure 130 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.08,
      "end_seconds": 101.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Is that all right? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.88,
      "end_seconds": 112.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Very good. I've already checked your pacemaker with the programmer this morning, before you came in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.0,
      "end_seconds": 119.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Did it hurt? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.64,
      "end_seconds": 131.17,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "You weren't even here. The device has been talking to the machine since eight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.35,
      "end_seconds": 138.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "Clever things. And what did it say? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.01,
      "end_seconds": 154.43,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "text": "The battery has about six years left, the wires are working properly, and the heart rhythm is well controlled. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.77,
      "end_seconds": 162.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Six years. I'll be ninety. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.06,
      "end_seconds": 171.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "I'll still be here, I hope, or my successor will. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.0,
      "end_seconds": 180.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Do I need to do anything differently? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.21,
      "end_seconds": 193.35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.14,
      "text": "Not at all. Carry on as you are, keep walking up the church hill, it's good for you. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.66,
      "end_seconds": 200.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I do the hill every Sunday. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.72,
      "end_seconds": 213.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Splendid. Just remember to carry your pacemaker card, and tell any dentist or surgeon you've got one. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.03,
      "end_seconds": 220.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I carry it everywhere. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.43,
      "end_seconds": 234.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "And mobile phones are fine, just don't keep one in your breast pocket over the device. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.73,
      "end_seconds": 240.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "In my trouser pocket, always. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.27,
      "end_seconds": 245.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Perfect. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.73,
      "end_seconds": 254.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Will I be seeing you again? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.28,
      "end_seconds": 272.29,
      "duration_seconds": 14.01,
      "text": "The pacemaker clinic will send you the next date. But if you have dizziness, a faint, a very slow pulse, or your chest muscle twitches, don't wait, ring us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.78,
      "end_seconds": 279.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "I'll ring straight away. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.54,
      "end_seconds": 290.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Lovely. Thank you for coming, and give my regards to your wife. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.92,
      "end_seconds": 299.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "I will. She'll be pleased to hear I passed. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.75,
      "end_seconds": 305.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "With flying colours. ~"
    }
  ]
}
